宜しくお願いします🙇🏻‍♂️\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ4A8HKJ1EP2NXFSSKPSP9K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 髪の毛伸びた〜🎅🏻\n \n \n 最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました(・ω・)\n \n かとし"}],"source":"archive"}}